          "type": "text",
          "text": "Workstation provides Python, pytest and a headless browser. I will test the retained file and render a local page."
        },
        {
          "type": "tool_call",
          "name": "shell",
          "arguments": {
            "command": "python3 -m pytest -q environment/test_persisted.py"
